        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama deepa goodiiy siyagi aba jeeda buuneeda ak gwasin riing'eeda nea mabaysiina ak gwasin ng'asheanjagi aba jeeda ng'asheega ayi NG'UTAMIIDA adoosinyi, was giidiinyeanda, ",
