          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda riing'eeda sin iisinung' ghwanal gaygweadu haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda, was mbooyda saawaat manda sirjeeda, aba badayda riing'eadaanyi ghayi sin. ",
