          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiin geatindaanyi uhuuda gidasighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda ak gwanuus gidasighadoawana riing'eeda aba heeda sigwariideaysa haleanjeeda ghadooweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
